      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think I would prefer checkAsyncWorkCompletion not have any big side effects like having to do a queue submit to the gpu. Like even with the syncCpu flag on it, its not 100% obvious from API POV that saying syncCpu would mean that work gets submitted to the GPU as well. I would prefer forcing clients to have just the one entry point to send and wait on work from the GPU, i.e. Context::submit",
